(): calculate gradients only", "fontSize": 27, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "2. backward(): calculate gradients only", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "2. backward(): calculate gradients only"}, {"id": "backward-body", "type": "text", "x": 1600, "y": 1010, "width": 700, "height": 130, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 510057, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 511057, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788998400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "d57", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Every trainable scalar gets its own .grad.\nExample conv grad = +0.014876\nExample feature 1 -> spiral grad = -0.061518\nNo weight value has changed yet.", "fontSize": 21, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Every trainable scalar gets its own .grad.\nExample conv grad = +0.014876\nExample feature 1 -> spiral grad = -0.061518\nNo weight value has changed yet.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": "Every trainable scalar gets its own .grad.\nExample conv grad = +0.014876\nExample feature 1 -> spiral grad = -0.061518\nNo weight value has changed yet."}, {"id": "a-loss-back", "type": "arrow", "x": 2150, "y": 830, "width": 100, "height": 100, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#c92a2e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 510058, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 511058, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1788998400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "d58", "points": [[0, 0], [-100, 100]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "